{"id":"huntik:page:5553","page_id":5553,"title":"Shadowknife","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Shadowknife is a spell used to throw magical knives at the enemy. The knives thrown will emit a purple glow, this spell can be cast while holding a knife or simply summoning it from the users hand. It is similar to the spell Knifepoint used by Celina and Bonnie.","profile":{"image":{"text":"file:S2E28 Shadowknife.jpg","wikitext":"file:S2E28 Shadowknife.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Violet","wikitext":"Violet","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Lin Storm\nMr. Wilder\nStack","wikitext":"[[Lin Storm]]<br>[[Mr. Wilder]] <br> [[Stack]]","links":[{"target_title":"Lin Storm","label":"Lin Storm","target_id":"huntik:page:4985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lin_Storm","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4985"},{"target_title":"Mr. Wilder","label":"Mr. Wilder","target_id":"huntik:page:4467","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mr._Wilder","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4467"},{"target_title":"Stack","label":"Stack","target_id":"huntik:page:4565","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Stack","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4565"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Tower of Nostradamus\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Tower of Nostradamus]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Tower of Nostradamus","label":"The Tower of Nostradamus","target_id":"huntik:page:6963","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Tower_of_Nostradamus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6963"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"Infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"file:S2E28 Shadowknife.jpg","value_text":"file:S2E28 Shadowknife.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet","value_text":"Violet","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Lin Storm]]<br>[[Mr. Wilder]] <br> [[Stack]]","value_text":"Lin Storm\nMr. Wilder\nStack","links":[{"target_title":"Lin Storm","label":"Lin Storm","target_id":"huntik:page:4985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lin_Storm","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4985"},{"target_title":"Mr. Wilder","label":"Mr. Wilder","target_id":"huntik:page:4467","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mr._Wilder","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4467"},{"target_title":"Stack","label":"Stack","target_id":"huntik:page:4565","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Stack","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4565"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Tower of Nostradamus]]\"","value_text":"\"The Tower of Nostradamus\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Tower of Nostradamus","label":"The Tower of Nostradamus","target_id":"huntik:page:6963","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Tower_of_Nostradamus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6963"}]}],"start":0,"end":190}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Wilder and Stack used this spell to manifest blades of energy at [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert]] but, in doing so, awakened the [[Sentry Triclops]] [[Titans]] left by [[Nostradamus]] to guard his [[Tower of Nostradamus|tower]]. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}} \n\nWhen [[Lin Storm]] fought against [[Dante Vale]] in training, she cast the spell on throwing knives that she was holding. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Wilder and Stack used this spell to manifest blades of energy at Dante Vale and Lok Lambert but, in doing so, awakened the Sentry Triclops Titans left by Nostradamus to guard his tower. [The Tower of Nostradamus]\n\nWhen Lin Storm fought against Dante Vale in training, she cast the spell on throwing knives that she was holding. [Lok's Leadership]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Lame furtive\n|POR=Sombra Cortante}}\n\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"French: Lame furtive\nPortuguese: Sombra Cortante"}],"full_text":"Shadowknife is a spell used to throw magical knives at the enemy. The knives thrown will emit a purple glow, this spell can be cast while holding a knife or simply summoning it from the users hand. It is similar to the spell Knifepoint used by Celina and Bonnie.\n\nHistory\n\nWilder and Stack used this spell to manifest blades of energy at Dante Vale and Lok Lambert but, in doing so, awakened the Sentry Triclops Titans left by Nostradamus to guard his tower. [The Tower of Nostradamus]\n\nWhen Lin Storm fought against Dante Vale in training, she cast the spell on throwing knives that she was holding. [Lok's Leadership]\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Lame furtive\nPortuguese: Sombra Cortante","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox spell\n| image = file:S2E28 Shadowknife.jpg\n| aura  = Violet\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Lin Storm]]<br>[[Mr. Wilder]] <br> [[Stack]]\n| first = \"[[The Tower of Nostradamus]]\"\n}}'''Shadowknife''' is a [[spell]] used to throw magical knives at the enemy. The knives thrown will emit a purple glow, this spell can be cast while holding a knife or simply summoning it from the users hand. It is similar to the spell [[Knifepoint]] used by [[Celina]] and [[Bonnie]].\n\n== History ==\nWilder and Stack used this spell to manifest blades of energy at [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert]] but, in doing so, awakened the [[Sentry Triclops]] [[Titans]] left by [[Nostradamus]] to guard his [[Tower of Nostradamus|tower]]. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}} \n\nWhen [[Lin Storm]] fought against [[Dante Vale]] in training, she cast the spell on throwing knives that she was holding. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Lame furtive\n|POR=Sombra Cortante}}\n\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:4985","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lin Storm","label":"Lin Storm","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lin_Storm","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4985"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4467","status":"resolved","target_title":"Mr. Wilder","label":"Mr. Wilder","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mr._Wilder","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4467"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4565","status":"resolved","target_title":"Stack","label":"Stack","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Stack","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4565"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:6963","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Tower of Nostradamus","label":"The Tower of Nostradamus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Tower_of_Nostradamus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6963"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8063","status":"resolved","target_title":"spell","label":"spell","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/spell","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8063"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:27660","status":"resolved","target_title":"Knifepoint","label":"Knifepoint","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Knifepoint","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A27660"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:16995","status":"resolved","target_title":"Celina","label":"Celina","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Celina","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A16995"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:17002","status":"resolved","target_title":"Bonnie","label":"Bonnie","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Bonnie","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17002"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lamb